This template is used to display hover text for icon buttons on the wiki's Cat Filter.

==Parameters==
<pre>{{FilterIconInfo|name|desc (optional)}}</pre>
The first parameter is the name of the ability or trait to display. If the second unnamed parameter is unused, a small box is displayed with only the name centered. If the second parameter is used, a larger box with fixed dimensions is shown with the name in lenticular brackets and the desc below on a new line.

==Usage==
<tabber>
No Desc=
<pre>{{FilterIconInfo|Traitless}}</pre>
===Result===
{{FilterIconInfo|Traitless}}

|-|With Desc=
<pre>{{FilterIconInfo|Weaken|Indicated enemy types will have their attack power reduced for a set period.}}</pre>
===Result===
{{FilterIconInfo|Weaken|Indicated enemy types will have their attack power reduced for a set period.}}
</tabber>

